OL,3,ANvidia reinstates CEO Jensen Huang
OL,4,Aafter affair with alleged spy as Trump
OL,5,Asays 'I made the deal'
OL,6,
OL,7,FNvidia has reinstated CEO Jensen Huang
OL,8,Fjust days after rejecting his offer to
OL,9,Freturn to the AI chipmaker - and less
OL,10,Fthan two weeks after he was forced to
OL,11,Fresign over reports of an affair with a
OL,12,Fsuspected Chinese spy.
OL,14,FThe company had come under pressure
OL,15,Ffrom Donald Trump to reappoint Huang -
OL,16,Fand on Monday, the US president said he
OL,17,F"made the deal" to "convince" the tech
OL,18,Fgiant's board to reverse course and
OL,19,Fbring Huang back.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
