OL,3,ANvidia reinstates CEO Jensen Huang
OL,4,Aafter affair with alleged spy as Trump
OL,5,Asays 'I made the deal'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Democrats have accused the Trump
OL,8,Fadministration of selling out national
OL,9,Fsecurity for financial gain. Huang is
OL,10,Fdue to testify before Congress in early
OL,11,FDecember.
OL,13,FHis comeback helped end a week-long
OL,14,Flosing streak in US stocks that had
OL,15,Fleft the S&P 500 in correction
OL,16,Fterritory.
